  <line id="tr_1_tl_6">tempus, quo plus essent valiturę; quem</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_7">Innocent. Ioann. Andr. Ancharan. Ho¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_8">stien. Panormit. Sotus lib. 6. de iustitia</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_9">q. 4. ar. 2. Couar. lib. 2. variarum oap. 3.n.</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_10">6. Maior. in 4. d. 15. q. 32. Angel. vsura 1.</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_11">q. 33. Rosel.ibi. num. 38. Sylu. ibi q. 2. ar. 2.</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_12">Azor. lib. 8. cap. 9. q. 1.vers. certum, &amp; ex¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_13">ploratum, asserunt posse iusta ratione</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_14">lucri cessantis suas merces vendere, siue</line>
