  <line id="tr_1_tl_25">Hinc benè Bonacin. excusat multis ti¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_26">tulis emptores lanarum anticipata solu¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_27">tione, si minori iusto titulo infimo e¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_28">mant. Primò propter lucrum cessans, &amp;</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_29">damnum emergens. Secundò propter</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_30">periculum solutionis lanarum tempore</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_31">praestituto. Tertiò, quia magnam co¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_32">piam lanarum ementes propter insoli¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_33">tam quantitatem de pretio communi</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_34">possunt deducere. Quartò, quia modus</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_35">vendendi praesenti nummo, &amp; absente</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_36">merce inducit raritatem emptorum, &amp;</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_37">copiam venditorum. Ita Bonac. bene</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_38">disp. 3. q. 2. punct. 4. num. 20. vers. hinc se¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_39">quitur.</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_40">Septima causa ab aliquibus additur,</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_41">donatio, seu condonatio pretij: quae</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_42">multa habet examinanda. Et primò qui¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_43">dem certum est, si vera sit donatio pre¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_44">tij eam non solum minuere, sed tollere</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_45">ominino, pro qua parte est; immo non</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_46">tantum pretium, sed &amp; ipsum contra¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_47">ctum emptionis, &amp; venditionis tollit</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_48">de medio, &amp; destruit, &amp; in naturam al¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_49">terius contractus specie distincti, nem¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_50">pe donationis conuertit. v. g. emit quis</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_51">centum fanecas tritici, quae pretio cur¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_52">renti valeret centum aureos, sed dona¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_53">re intendens emit 50. aureis, dicendus</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_54">est iste venditor 50. fanecas vendere,</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_55">&amp; 50. donare, quod si omnes centum</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_56">aureos donaret dicendum esset tunc,</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_57">nullam iam partem emptionis, &amp; ven¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_58">ditionis remanere; quia sine pretio nul¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_59">la venditio est in venditione 11. ff. de</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_60">act. emption. &amp; lifidonationis 3. C. de</line>
</lines>
